k"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○ゆんちゃん最近の楽しみなことなに？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→AGESTOCKと3期生4期生合同ライブ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○野菜好きって言ってたけどサラダにかけるとしたら何ドレッシング？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→イタリアンドレッシングかレモンドレッシング！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○雪が積もったら雪で何か作る派？それとも雪合戦派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→雪だるまとか作って遊んでから雪合戦！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○やる気出ないときどーやってモチベーションあげてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→やる気を出すべき理由とメリットを考える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○もしゆなちゃんが男の子に生まれ変わったら名前なんになりたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→男の子も女の子もどっちでも合いそうな名前がいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"○今年の冬にしたいことはな〜〜〜〜に？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→あーちゃんの家のコタツでダラダラ過ごしたい！これができれば今年は満足(-.-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！そうあのね、前書いたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"あーちゃん\"は おばあちゃんのこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おばあちゃんとあーちゃんは同一人物です☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"b