ype":"paragraph","text":"ども、ポカです。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__31105035_0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんじつは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みくにんこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髙橋のばーすでー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背は高いけどあんなにちいさかった髙橋も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまやりっぱなお姉さんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四期生がどうやらみんな慕ってるみたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなエピソードも聞けたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タレコミいってみましょ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・いつも周りに人が自然に集まってくる （by まねーじゃー）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかる〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髙橋がいるとなんか近寄ってっちゃうポカも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってほら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__31105038_0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近寄りたくなるよね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・私服がものすごくおしゃれ （by まねーじゃー）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りあるにポカ（小）の46倍くらいの等身があるので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばつぐんスタイルでなんでもにあうからうらやましいかぎり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゃくに髙橋がなんでも着こなせちゃうから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカは服を着なくなりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何着ても勝てないと悟って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__31105039_0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"背が高いから待ち合わせにもべんり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みくにが立ってるところしゅうごう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でみんなあつまります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・四期生の前ではお姉さんとして慕われているよう。正源司にずっと抱きつかれてるところを見たことがあります （by まねーじゃー）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっこりエピソードとみせかけて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よーこの狂気を全力でかんじるよね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶん髙橋を見るとりあるに犬になるんだとおもう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・じゃがいものお菓子とたらこパスタがすごく大好き（by ひなの)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーパーからじゃがいものお菓子とたらこパスタ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"売り切れます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・未来虹は自分のことを大食いだと思っているが、実は全然大食いではない (by まりもと)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはまりもと視点だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったくあてにならない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも大食いじゃないのにあんなに背が高くなるなら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひけつをおしえてほしい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・意外と乙女でキュンキュンするドラマや漫画で良くキャーキャー言っています (by ぱるよ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとポカも一緒にキャーキャーしてくる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なちゅらるぼーんひとたらしな髙橋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__31105040_0.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのもしさばつぐんなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポカはChatGPTくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髙橋になんでも聞いちゃいます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こまったら髙橋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これポカのなかでの合言葉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもたのもしくあれ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あらためてたんじょうびおめでとう〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__31145995.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official